# Excluded from the deployed plugin artifact.
#
# Almost nothing belongs here any more. Since the Step 10h restructure the artifact is
# built by copying the `beyond-elysium/` subfolder wholesale - what ships is a directory,
# not the repo root minus forty exclusions. Everything that must never ship (the Grapevine
# source archive, the planning docs, tests, tooling, sample data) simply lives outside that
# subfolder and cannot reach the artifact by any path.
#
# That is the point of the restructure: `v0.9.15` shipped `pp-samples/` by accident because
# it was untracked and therefore invisible to every check except this file, and `v0.21.29`
# shipped the repo-root agent-instructions file for months because nothing here named it.
# Neither class of mistake is reachable now.
#
# `build/` and `vendor/` live inside the subfolder and MUST ship - they are the compiled
# bundle and the Composer autoloader, gitignored but required at runtime.

# OS noise that can appear inside any directory, including the shippable one.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
